# 1️⃣ Reverse a String

## 📖 Definition

Reversing a string means arranging its characters in the opposite order.

---

### Example

Before

```text
Hello
```

After

```text
olleH
```

---

### Approach

Use the **Two Pointer Technique**.

```
left = 0

right = length - 1

Swap characters

Move left++

Move right--
```

---

### C++ Code

```cpp
#include<iostream>
using namespace std;

int main()
{
    string str = "Hello";

    int left = 0;
    int right = str.length()-1;

    while(left < right)
    {
        swap(str[left], str[right]);
        left++;
        right--;
    }

    cout<<str;
}
```

---

### Time Complexity

```
O(n)
```

### Space Complexity

```
O(1)
```

