# 2️⃣ Check Palindrome

## 📖 Definition

A palindrome is a string that reads the same from both directions.

---

### Examples

```text
madam ✔

racecar ✔

hello ✘
```

---

### Algorithm

```
Compare first and last characters

Move towards the center

If mismatch occurs

Not Palindrome
```

---

### C++ Code

```cpp
bool isPalindrome(string str)
{
    int left = 0;
    int right = str.length()-1;

    while(left < right)
    {
        if(str[left] != str[right])
            return false;

        left++;
        right--;
    }

    return true;
}
```

---

### Time Complexity

```
O(n)
```

### Space Complexity

```
O(1)
```

