# 💡 Interview Tips

✅ Reverse String and Palindrome are classic **Two Pointer** problems.

✅ Character Frequency is the foundation for many hashing problems.

✅ Anagrams always have the same character frequency.

✅ Strings are immutable in some languages (like Java), but mutable in C++ using `std::string`.

✅ Most string interview questions involve traversal, frequency counting, or two pointers.

